            "location": {
              "line": 3,
              "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)"
            },
            "text": "Q: Is the doorstep test drive service available in all cities?\nA: Yes, we offer this service pan India, including all major cities and nearby locations."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "location": {
              "line": 6,
              "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)"
            },
            "text": "Q: Are there any charges for doorstep test drives?\nA: No, this service is absolutely free."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "location": {
              "line": 9,
              "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)"
            },
            "text": "Q: Can I test more than one model/variant?\nA: Absolutely! Just mention all the models/variants in your request."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "location": {
              "line": 12,
              "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)"
            },
            "text": "Q: Do I need to submit any documents?\nA: Please keep a valid driving license handy for verification before the test drive."
          }
        ],
        "sections": []
      }
